  "title": "LauHilLau Cookies",
  "description": "This LauHilLau cookie recipe is made with oatmeal, banana, chocolate chips, and peanut butter. This is a 5 star recipe, designed by two professional cooks. The cookie consists of delicious ingredients, and we hope you enjoy it.",
